+# Audit: the Quiet link (0.24.0)
+
+Date: 2026-11-03 · PR: Cochilo 0.31.0 · Auditor: Claude (graphic-design-fundamentals + impeccable)
+
+## Scope
+
+One component for a link out of the app that must not compete with the screen's action. Roles
+`muted`, `ink`; the line-set chevron; no tokens.
+
+## graphic-design-fundamentals (§13 checklist)
+
+| # | Question | Result |
+|---|---|---|
+| 1 | Brief | Pass: findable, never pushy |
+| 2 | Concept | Pass: a sentence with an action at its end |
+| 3 | Hierarchy | Pass: below the content it refers to, smallest role |
+| 4 | Contrast | Pass: muted and ink on surface (listed pairs) |
+| 5 | Alignment and grid | Pass: aligned to the group's inset |
+| 6 | Spacing | Pass: space2 between line and action |
+| 7 | Typography | Pass: meta, sentence case |
+| 8 | Colour | Pass: no teal, no data colour |
+| 9 | Consistency | Pass: the rows' chevron |
+| 10 | Simplicity | Pass |
+| 11 | Real-size test | Pass: Cochilo `fabric_shop_line_ptBR_light` |
+| 12 | Accessibility and ergonomics | Pass: 48dp, one button, a full spoken sentence |
+| 13 | Production | Pass |
+
+## impeccable (audit)
+
+| # | Dimension | Score | Key finding |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | Accessibility | 4 | Spoken sentence names the product and says it opens the browser |
+| 2 | Performance | 4 | — |
+| 3 | Appearance & theming | 4 | Roles only |
+| 4 | Platform conformance | 4 | — |
+| 5 | Adaptivity | 4 | Wraps at large text |
+| | **Total** | **20/20** | |
